{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">[00:00]</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Helvetica, \"sans-serif\", \"microsoft jhenghei\";'>天文台：受廣闊低壓槽影響，本港今日雨勢有時頗大及有狂風雷暴。天文台在有需要時會發出暴雨警告信號或局部地區大雨提示。市民上班上學前請留意天文台的最新天氣消息。</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-28T17:19:20.429728+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":86,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}